The Berlin hundreds march through Wedding on a Sunday morning. The Schupo arrest four hundred of them, and the rest learn to drill in the woods at night.

@saxony
subtitle: The Right's answer. The hundreds grow where they are legal; Saxony becomes their base.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_may = 2;
Q.red_guards_strength += 4;
Q.district_saxony_loyalty += 4;
Q.district_thuringia_loyalty += 4;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

In Prussia the hundreds become sports clubs and hiking societies. In Saxony and Thuringia they become an army in grey windcheaters.

